{
    "background_story": "Ezrah grew up in a small village on the outskirts of a vast desert, where hunting was a way of life. From a young age, he was fascinated by the ancient art of marksmanship, spending hours practicing with his grandfather's worn rifle. Ezrah's natural talent and dedication quickly made him a skilled shooter, able to hit targets with unerring accuracy. As he honed his craft, he became known throughout the region for his exceptional marksmanship. Ezrah's skills were put to the test when a severe drought struck the land, and food became scarce. He used his expertise to provide for his community, bringing down game with precision and care. His reputation as a master marksman spread far and wide, earning him a place among the village's most respected hunters.",
